1
00:00:00,838 --> 00:00:03,068
(Sheldon:)So, you agree with my friends

2
00:00:03,074 --> 00:00:05,274
(Sheldon:)that I should skip the premiere?

3
00:00:05,276 --> 00:00:08,916
(Arthur:)Uh, do... do you
love this girl?

4
00:00:08,913 --> 00:00:10,843
(Sheldon:)Yes.

5
00:00:10,848 --> 00:00:14,118
(Sheldon:)But she knows how important
Star Wars is to me.

6
00:00:14,118 --> 00:00:16,418
(Arthur:)Well, maybe
you should show her how...

7
00:00:16,421 --> 00:00:19,251
how important she is to you.

8
00:00:19,257 --> 00:00:23,027
(Sheldon:)By seeing the movie
she'd want me to see?

9
00:00:24,195 --> 00:00:27,435
Sheldon, you-you can see
this movie whenever you want.

10
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:31,633
(Arthur:)But you only have
a limited number of days

11
00:00:31,636 --> 00:00:34,766
that you-you can be
with this woman.

12
00:00:34,772 --> 00:00:36,602
(Arthur:)Be with her.

13
00:00:38,443 --> 00:00:40,373
(Sheldon:)You're right.

14
00:00:40,378 --> 00:00:42,048
(Caption:)Great.

15
00:00:42,914 --> 00:00:44,884
(Sheldon:)Where are you going?

16
00:00:44,882 --> 00:00:49,782
(Arthur:)I don't know, but hopefully,
somewhere I can wear pants.

17
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:59,020
(cell phone ringtone playing)

